  "results": [
    "Swap: 3:32 and 3:42. Zcash shows two shielded transactions with no transparent input or output; Ethereum shows lock, claim, withdraw.",
    "Bob’s app crashes: 3:47. Bob’s app was SIGKILLed right after Alice’s claim and restarted eight seconds later; it claimed the ZEC from its journal and t on Ethereum. Zcash again showed only two shielded transactions.",
    "Both refund: 3:37. Bob refunded and withdrew his ETH; Zcash shows F (shielded), then A with one 20,000-zatoshi transparent output, then R spending it with a 15,000-zatoshi transparent change output to the same address.",
    "Relay: 8 messages per trade, 6 sealed, in every run."
