  "defects_found_and_fixed": [
    "After New trade the stage loaded both app frames before the restarted app servers listened, leaving them blank. /api/public now reports whether each app answers, and the stage loads a frame only then.",
    "The regtest block reward halves every 864 blocks; from height 6,041 one coinbase (0.0163 ZEC) no longer funds a 0.019 ZEC quote, so the refund run’s Prepare exits kept failing and Autoplay kept retrying. Demo quotes are now 0.015 ZEC for 0.0293 ETH, scaled down when one reward cannot cover that; Autoplay stops after four failed presses of the same action; operator refusals now record their cause in the operator’s own private directory.",
    "The refund R returns 15,000 zatoshi of change to the auxiliary transparent address. The site, stage, privacy doc and submission said \"one transparent coin\"; they now name both outputs."
  ],
